outputs/05c_cluster_cv_leakage_sensitivity/chemprop_runs/
outputs/05c_cluster_cv_leakage_sensitivity/predictions/
outputs/05c_cluster_cv_leakage_sensitivity/scores/

# 15_analog_holdout_comparison (analog-holdout split, scripts/15_run_analog_holdout.py):
# chemprop_runs/ (250MB, checked directly -- the one chemprop_chemeleoninit training run
# this step needed) is excluded, same reasoning as 10/12 above -- fully regeneratable by
